        return 'WORN COSMETICS CLOSE-UP on original mature ADULT women age25-40. '+framing+'. '+focus+'. Consistent natural brown iris, normal adult eye proportions and realistic eyelid skin in every cell. Clean polished semi-realistic anime illustration, precise cosmetic edges and tiny lashes. NOT isolated palettes, swatches, brushes, packaging, logos, facial injuries or generic eye icons. Use the exact color zones, matte/shimmer/metallic/glitter properties and line shapes described. Every eye corner and brow tip fits inside its own grid cell with generous gutters. No lips, breasts, hands, text other than one exact ID. LANDSCAPE canvas1536x1024, exactly4 columns by4 rows,16 cells, visible fine gray straight separators at quarter axes. No title or footer.'

