        if dimension=='佩戴发绳的完整发型':return common+'REALISTIC WORN HAIR TIES based on ordinary elastic rings, seamless fabric loops, scrunchies, telephone-cord coils and independent short knotted cords. Each cell has ONE main complete hairstyle on a mature woman age25-40 in opaque plain grey high-neck top, seen from rear/side as specified, plus ONE circular detail inset in a lower corner showing the SAME tie ACTUALLY AROUND the same hair root or braid end. Inset is just close hair and tie, not another head, loose product, scalp section or diagram. Main hairstyle shows complete crown, whole gathered ponytail/braid/bun and every hair tip, with ample margin. Use shoulder-blade length or shorter, never crop long hair. Hair converges into a genuinely cinched bundle: elastic ring loops AROUND its full circumference; hair passes continuously THROUGH the center and fans below. Scrunchies have wrinkled fabric OUTSIDE a tightened elastic core, not a giant solid flower. Phone-cord tie is one continuous small coiled filament stretched into a closed ring, not stack of beads or metal coils. Paired ponytails each have their OWN independent tie, no connector behind neck. Avoid imaginary hardware, bungee hooks, sliders, sleeve cuffs or decorative beads replacing the functional tie. Accurate cloth/velvet/satin/rib/terry texture, enough contrast against dark hair to see contact. At least one visible full closure/loop on viewer side; no floating ties, missing roots, hair penetrating solid ornament or generic recolors. Inset supports clear visual inspection of actual fastening.'
        if dimension=='佩戴发箍的完整发型':return common+'HEADBANDS follow real skull curvature from one EAR-BEHIND end across crown to other ear-behind end. They partly go INTO hair and do not float above scalp or pass across eyes. Distinguish rigid narrow, wide satin, padded, top-knot, pearl row, small side-flower, double-track, wavy metal, sporty cloth/knit, lace and braided bands. Hair ornaments and actual bob/curls/updo/ponytail vary as listed, not sixteen headband recolors. Soft band wraps naturally around back of head; pearl/flower elements attach to actual band. '
        return common+'HAIRPINS / U-PINS / FORKS / ORNAMENTAL COMBS SECURE ACTUAL UPDOS. Show mostly rear three-quarter so the entire bun/twist and insertion roots are readable. Pin shaft goes THROUGH HAIR BUN, with one insertion point and reasonable exposed head/tip, never through flesh, face, ear or neck. U-pin two legs enter SAME bundle, fork parallel rods enter hair at same region, comb teeth insert into bun edge and decorative crown stays outside hair. Retain distinct wood, metal, leaf/crescent/flower/ring/branch top, short hanging chains, crossed pins, hairnet and half-up hairstyle. No huge dangling weapons or famous emblems. '
