    if cat=='body' and dimension.startswith('成年尺寸对照'):
        angle='STRICT ORTHOGRAPHIC FRONT, symmetrical face and torso facing viewer, arms comfortably away from waist so contour reads' if dimension.endswith('正面') else 'STRICT 90-DEGREE RIGHT-FACING SIDE PROFILE, face, torso, pelvis, legs and shoes all face right, never three-quarter or front'
        return ('NONSEXUAL TECHNICAL ADULT FEMALE DIMENSION COMPARISON, women unmistakably age 25-40. '+angle+'. Same brown low bun, natural mature face and realistic adult proportions. All wear IDENTICAL COMPLETE OPAQUE MATTE GREY crew-neck LONG-SLEEVE FITTED ATHLETIC TOP and DARK-GREY FULL-LENGTH FITTED ATHLETIC TROUSERS, flat shoes. Clothing reveals the overall silhouette through ordinary fit, no anatomical surface detail, nipple/areola outlines, nudity, underwear, skinpaint, transparent fabric or sexual pose. Each cell has one complete crown-to-soles adult standing normally, hands relaxed just clear of body, neutral supported pelvis, no arched back. FIRST EIGHT cells show A75, B75, C75, D75, E75, F75, G75, H75: SAME underbust 75cm, stature165cm, shoulder width38cm, waist70cm and hips94cm; only natural clothed chest volume changes gradually from very shallow A to fuller H. Read actual fictional bust measurements, make a clearly perceptible gradual side silhouette change across A-H WITHOUT changing waist/hips or making identical figures. Cells9-16 change ONLY the specified single dimension relative to the C75 baseline in cell3: stature150, stature180, narrow shoulders34, broad shoulders44, waist62, waist88, hips86, hips110. Preserve natural anatomy: larger waist is a visibly fuller torso, broad hips alter pelvis/upper thigh contour, shoulder width alters actual shoulder span, never substitute posture or a baggy garment. Height variants have proportionate natural adult limbs and are not children or stretched skinny models. Do NOT draw measurements, arrows, rulers, cup text, labels or text other than exact BO ID. The webpage draws all exact dimension text and scales the complete figures to a common illustrative stature scale. PERFECTLY FLAT IVORY background, minimal shading, no floor shadows. Leave 40 pixels above hair and 18 below soles, thin straight grid rules. Every figure stays entirely inside its cell, no detached body parts. ')

